rong>The next step is to apply face detection. Here we=E2=80=99ve used a de=
ep learning method to perform face detection with OpenCV.</figcaption></fig=
ure></div>



<p>Once we know <em>where</em> in the image the face is, we can extract the=
 face Region of Interest (ROI):</p>



<div class=3D"wp-block-image"><figure class=3D"aligncenter size-large is-re=
