-status=3D"loaded"><figcaption><strong>Figure 5:</strong> The next step is =
to extract the face ROI with OpenCV and NumPy slicing.</figcaption></figure=
></div>



<p>And from there, we apply facial landmarks, allowing us to localize the e=
yes, nose, mouth, etc.:</p>



<div class=3D"wp-block-image"><figure class=3D"aligncenter size-large is-re=
