ons.</figcaption></figure></div>



<p>This mask will be <em>automatically</em> applied to the face by using th=
e facial landmarks (namely the points along the chin and nose) to compute <=
em>where</em> the mask will be placed.</p>



<p>The mask is then resized and rotated, placing it on the face:</p>



<div class=3D"wp-block-image"><figure class=3D"aligncenter size-large"><img=
